  "batch_edn": "{\"source\" \":agent/codex\" \"forms\" [[:db/add \"07cda746-87cb-5523-93ce-d92d3a75a507\" :answer/id #uuid \"07cda746-87cb-5523-93ce-d92d3a75a507\"] [:db/add \"07cda746-87cb-5523-93ce-d92d3a75a507\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"07cda746-87cb-5523-93ce-d92d3a75a507\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"07cda746-87cb-5523-93ce-d92d3a75a507\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"e3d6d198-0795-5155-a94f-e9ba7449736a\" :answer/id #uuid \"e3d6d198-0795-5155-a94f-e9ba7449736a\"] [:db/add \"e3d6d198-0795-5155-a94f-e9ba7449736a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"e3d6d198-0795-5155-a94f-e9ba7449736a\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"e3d6d198-0795-5155-a94f-e9ba7449736a\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"76b66486-a4e5-5cb2-a0e3-13bc3be03fd8\" :answer/id #uuid \"76b66486-a4e5-5cb2-a0e3-13bc3be03fd8\"] [:db/add \"76b66486-a4e5-5cb2-a0e3-13bc3be03fd8\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"76b66486-a4e5-5cb2-a0e3-13bc3be03fd8\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"76b66486-a4e5-5cb2-a0e3-13bc3be03fd8\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"7a05fcc2-1905-5746-b765-f0093ad64183\" :answer/id #uuid \"7a05fcc2-1905-5746-b765-f0093ad64183\"] [:db/add \"7a05fcc2-1905-5746-b765-f0093ad64183\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"7a05fcc2-1905-5746-b765-f0093ad64183\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{12}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"7a05fcc2-1905-5746-b765-f0093ad64183\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"9636625a-1efe-52f4-8200-3a1031432e07\" :answer/id #uuid \"9636625a-1efe-52f4-8200-3a1031432e07\"] [:db/add \"9636625a-1efe-52f4-8200-3a1031432e07\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"9636625a-1efe-52f4-8200-3a1031432e07\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"9636625a-1efe-52f4-8200-3a1031432e07\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"dd581dc8-7072-5e17-a1d9-7722221a47a2\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"dd581dc8-7072-5e17-a1d9-7722221a47a2\"] [:db/add \"dd581dc8-7072-5e17-a1d9-7722221a47a2\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"dd581dc8-7072-5e17-a1d9-7722221a47a2\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"dd581dc8-7072-5e17-a1d9-7722221a47a2\" :answer-field/choices \"07cda746-87cb-5523-93ce-d92d3a75a507\"] [:db/add \"dd581dc8-7072-5e17-a1d9-7722221a47a2\" :answer-field/choices \"e3d6d198-0795-5155-a94f-e9ba7449736a\"] [:db/add \"dd581dc8-7072-5e17-a1d9-7722221a47a2\" :answer-field/choices \"76b66486-a4e5-5cb2-a0e3-13bc3be03fd8\"] [:db/add \"dd581dc8-7072-5e17-a1d9-7722221a47a2\" :answer-field/choices \"7a05fcc2-1905-5746-b765-f0093ad64183\"] [:db/add \"dd581dc8-7072-5e17-a1d9-7722221a47a2\" :answer-field/choices \"9636625a-1efe-52f4-8200-3a1031432e07\"] [:db/add \"dd581dc8-7072-5e17-a1d9-7722221a47a2\" :answer-field/correct \"76b66486-a4e5-5cb2-a0e3-13bc3be03fd8\"] [:db/ensure \"dd581dc8-7072-5e17-a1d9-7722221a47a2\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"5a88e33b-bcc9-5d5e-854e-716b08caf25b\" :question/id #uuid \"5a88e33b-bcc9-5d5e-854e-716b08caf25b\"] [:db/add \"5a88e33b-bcc9-5d5e-854e-716b08caf25b\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=4 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{|4 x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"5a88e33b-bcc9-5d5e-854e-716b08caf25b\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $1\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{4}=\\\\frac{1}{4}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{|4 x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"5a88e33b-bcc9-5d5e-854e-716b08caf25b\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"5a88e33b-bcc9-5d5e-854e-716b08caf25b\" :question/answer-fields \"dd581dc8-7072-5e17-a1d9-7722221a47a2\"] [:db/ensure \"5a88e33b-bcc9-5d5e-854e-716b08caf25b\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"5a88e33b-bcc9-5d5e-854e-716b08caf25b\"] [:db/add \"ee416b02-f6d8-5944-80fd-be5c1139ab5b\" :answer/id #uuid \"ee416b02-f6d8-5944-80fd-be5c1139ab5b\"] [:db/add \"ee416b02-f6d8-5944-80fd-be5c1139ab5b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"ee416b02-f6d8-5944-80fd-be5c1139ab5b\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{16}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"ee416b02-f6d8-5944-80fd-be5c1139ab5b\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"bf2c5ecf-f3f2-5296-9a0c-c0709aac3499\" :answer/id #uuid \"bf2c5ecf-f3f2-5296-9a0c-c0709aac3499\"] [:db/add \"bf2c5ecf-f3f2-5296-9a0c-c0709aac3499\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"bf2c5ecf-f3f2-5296-9a0c-c0709aac3499\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"bf2c5ecf-f3f2-5296-9a0c-c0709aac3499\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"73f79e13-5a4d-54bc-bc00-e8736a06220a\" :answer/id #uuid \"73f79e13-5a4d-54bc-bc00-e8736a06220a\"] [:db/add \"73f79e13-5a4d-54bc-bc00-e8736a06220a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"73f79e13-5a4d-54bc-bc00-e8736a06220a\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"73f79e13-5a4d-54bc-bc00-e8736a06220a\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"60092078-6452-5e24-a9d5-9fa39bdb5e4b\" :answer/id #uuid \"60092078-6452-5e24-a9d5-9fa39bdb5e4b\"] [:db/add \"60092078-6452-5e24-a9d5-9fa39bdb5e4b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"60092078-6452-5e24-a9d5-9fa39bdb5e4b\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{9}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"60092078-6452-5e24-a9d5-9fa39bdb5e4b\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"78afbe40-2982-59b6-a929-b741df18ec7b\" :answer/id #uuid \"78afbe40-2982-59b6-a929-b741df18ec7b\"] [:db/add \"78afbe40-2982-59b6-a929-b741df18ec7b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"78afbe40-2982-59b6-a929-b741df18ec7b\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{8}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"78afbe40-2982-59b6-a929-b741df18ec7b\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"a62533c6-7811-5118-b3f3-09b68014a85a\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"a62533c6-7811-5118-b3f3-09b68014a85a\"] [:db/add \"a62533c6-7811-5118-b3f3-09b68014a85a\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"a62533c6-7811-5118-b3f3-09b68014a85a\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"a62533c6-7811-5118-b3f3-09b68014a85a\" :answer-field/choices \"ee416b02-f6d8-5944-80fd-be5c1139ab5b\"] [:db/add \"a62533c6-7811-5118-b3f3-09b68014a85a\" :answer-field/choices \"bf2c5ecf-f3f2-5296-9a0c-c0709aac3499\"] [:db/add \"a62533c6-7811-5118-b3f3-09b68014a85a\" :answer-field/choices \"73f79e13-5a4d-54bc-bc00-e8736a06220a\"] [:db/add \"a62533c6-7811-5118-b3f3-09b68014a85a\" :answer-field/choices \"60092078-6452-5e24-a9d5-9fa39bdb5e4b\"] [:db/add \"a62533c6-7811-5118-b3f3-09b68014a85a\" :answer-field/choices \"78afbe40-2982-59b6-a929-b741df18ec7b\"] [:db/add \"a62533c6-7811-5118-b3f3-09b68014a85a\" :answer-field/correct \"bf2c5ecf-f3f2-5296-9a0c-c0709aac3499\"] [:db/ensure \"a62533c6-7811-5118-b3f3-09b68014a85a\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"02d4a9ce-1e83-5227-93dc-e7eb1721bb86\" :question/id #uuid \"02d4a9ce-1e83-5227-93dc-e7eb1721bb86\"] [:db/add \"02d4a9ce-1e83-5227-93dc-e7eb1721bb86\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=4 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|4 x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"02d4a9ce-1e83-5227-93dc-e7eb1721bb86\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{4}=\\\\frac{3}{4}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|4 x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"02d4a9ce-1e83-5227-93dc-e7eb1721bb86\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"02d4a9ce-1e83-5227-93dc-e7eb1721bb86\" :question/answer-fields \"a62533c6-7811-5118-b3f3-09b68014a85a\"] [:db/ensure \"02d4a9ce-1e83-5227-93dc-e7eb1721bb86\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"02d4a9ce-1e83-5227-93dc-e7eb1721bb86\"] [:db/add \"bfaf2f4c-f15d-5675-9ff1-12e8c2ccd8d2\" :answer/id #uuid \"bfaf2f4c-f15d-5675-9ff1-12e8c2ccd8d2\"] [:db/add \"bfaf2f4c-f15d-5675-9ff1-12e8c2ccd8d2\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"bfaf2f4c-f15d-5675-9ff1-12e8c2ccd8d2\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"bfaf2f4c-f15d-5675-9ff1-12e8c2ccd8d2\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"66d53b5c-25c6-5e85-b9ce-f6e358d39a5e\" :answer/id #uuid \"66d53b5c-25c6-5e85-b9ce-f6e358d39a5e\"] [:db/add \"66d53b5c-25c6-5e85-b9ce-f6e358d39a5e\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"66d53b5c-25c6-5e85-b9ce-f6e358d39a5e\" :answer/value \"\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\"] [:db/ensure \"66d53b5c-25c6-5e85-b9ce-f6e358d39a5e\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"2ea2ff82-703c-54b1-92a1-8595617df0fd\" :answer/id #uuid \"2ea2ff82-703c-54b1-92a1-8595617df0fd\"] [:db/add \"2ea2ff82-703c-54b1-92a1-8595617df0fd\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"2ea2ff82-703c-54b1-92a1-8595617df0fd\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"2ea2ff82-703c-54b1-92a1-8595617df0fd\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"5b45ec8c-cc02-52b4-a17d-ac1aa6bc158d\" :answer/id #uuid \"5b45ec8c-cc02-52b4-a17d-ac1aa6bc158d\"] [:db/add \"5b45ec8c-cc02-52b4-a17d-ac1aa6bc158d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"5b45ec8c-cc02-52b4-a17d-ac1aa6bc158d\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"5b45ec8c-cc02-52b4-a17d-ac1aa6bc158d\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"331b5cab-6236-5757-8d95-e849b6b2f857\" :answer/id #uuid \"331b5cab-6236-5757-8d95-e849b6b2f857\"] [:db/add \"331b5cab-6236-5757-8d95-e849b6b2f857\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"331b5cab-6236-5757-8d95-e849b6b2f857\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"331b5cab-6236-5757-8d95-e849b6b2f857\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"8b55815a-5fe7-563c-b750-34ce11ba09ee\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"8b55815a-5fe7-563c-b750-34ce11ba09ee\"] [:db/add \"8b55815a-5fe7-563c-b750-34ce11ba09ee\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"8b55815a-5fe7-563c-b750-34ce11ba09ee\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"8b55815a-5fe7-563c-b750-34ce11ba09ee\" :answer-field/choices \"bfaf2f4c-f15d-5675-9ff1-12e8c2ccd8d2\"] [:db/add \"8b55815a-5fe7-563c-b750-34ce11ba09ee\" :answer-field/choices \"66d53b5c-25c6-5e85-b9ce-f6e358d39a5e\"] [:db/add \"8b55815a-5fe7-563c-b750-34ce11ba09ee\" :answer-field/choices \"2ea2ff82-703c-54b1-92a1-8595617df0fd\"] [:db/add \"8b55815a-5fe7-563c-b750-34ce11ba09ee\" :answer-field/choices \"5b45ec8c-cc02-52b4-a17d-ac1aa6bc158d\"] [:db/add \"8b55815a-5fe7-563c-b750-34ce11ba09ee\" :answer-field/choices \"331b5cab-6236-5757-8d95-e849b6b2f857\"] [:db/add \"8b55815a-5fe7-563c-b750-34ce11ba09ee\" :answer-field/correct \"66d53b5c-25c6-5e85-b9ce-f6e358d39a5e\"] [:db/ensure \"8b55815a-5fe7-563c-b750-34ce11ba09ee\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"94bc0fd8-e241-534c-9870-ebf348fb3dca\" :question/id #uuid \"94bc0fd8-e241-534c-9870-ebf348fb3dca\"] [:db/add \"94bc0fd8-e241-534c-9870-ebf348fb3dca\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=2 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|2 x|\\\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"94bc0fd8-e241-534c-9870-ebf348fb3dca\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|2 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{2}=1$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|2 x|\\\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"94bc0fd8-e241-534c-9870-ebf348fb3dca\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"94bc0fd8-e241-534c-9870-ebf348fb3dca\" :question/answer-fields \"8b55815a-5fe7-563c-b750-34ce11ba09ee\"] [:db/ensure \"94bc0fd8-e241-534c-9870-ebf348fb3dca\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"94bc0fd8-e241-534c-9870-ebf348fb3dca\"] [:db/add \"e7fbdf1f-8fe3-5789-b214-1a40b7b2b6ee\" :answer/id #uuid \"e7fbdf1f-8fe3-5789-b214-1a40b7b2b6ee\"] [:db/add \"e7fbdf1f-8fe3-5789-b214-1a40b7b2b6ee\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"e7fbdf1f-8fe3-5789-b214-1a40b7b2b6ee\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"e7fbdf1f-8fe3-5789-b214-1a40b7b2b6ee\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"2d46568f-35d0-59e3-bb81-1bf1bf2f5835\" :answer/id #uuid \"2d46568f-35d0-59e3-bb81-1bf1bf2f5835\"] [:db/add \"2d46568f-35d0-59e3-bb81-1bf1bf2f5835\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"2d46568f-35d0-59e3-bb81-1bf1bf2f5835\" :answer/value \"\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\"] [:db/ensure \"2d46568f-35d0-59e3-bb81-1bf1bf2f5835\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"1282b5ae-e8e0-5fbd-91f3-9ef00f1ed768\" :answer/id #uuid \"1282b5ae-e8e0-5fbd-91f3-9ef00f1ed768\"] [:db/add \"1282b5ae-e8e0-5fbd-91f3-9ef00f1ed768\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"1282b5ae-e8e0-5fbd-91f3-9ef00f1ed768\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"1282b5ae-e8e0-5fbd-91f3-9ef00f1ed768\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"fc076000-db2a-5052-b4c4-0e2e2eca2e22\" :answer/id #uuid \"fc076000-db2a-5052-b4c4-0e2e2eca2e22\"] [:db/add \"fc076000-db2a-5052-b4c4-0e2e2eca2e22\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"fc076000-db2a-5052-b4c4-0e2e2eca2e22\" :answer/value \"-2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"fc076000-db2a-5052-b4c4-0e2e2eca2e22\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"0591c87c-b5fd-5b16-8be3-400aa1f889a5\" :answer/id #uuid \"0591c87c-b5fd-5b16-8be3-400aa1f889a5\"] [:db/add \"0591c87c-b5fd-5b16-8be3-400aa1f889a5\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"0591c87c-b5fd-5b16-8be3-400aa1f889a5\" :answer/value \"-1\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"0591c87c-b5fd-5b16-8be3-400aa1f889a5\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"bc3140f2-15c8-5cf2-9ee2-08c72d9691af\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"bc3140f2-15c8-5cf2-9ee2-08c72d9691af\"] [:db/add \"bc3140f2-15c8-5cf2-9ee2-08c72d9691af\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"bc3140f2-15c8-5cf2-9ee2-08c72d9691af\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"bc3140f2-15c8-5cf2-9ee2-08c72d9691af\" :answer-field/choices \"e7fbdf1f-8fe3-5789-b214-1a40b7b2b6ee\"] [:db/add \"bc3140f2-15c8-5cf2-9ee2-08c72d9691af\" :answer-field/choices \"2d46568f-35d0-59e3-bb81-1bf1bf2f5835\"] [:db/add \"bc3140f2-15c8-5cf2-9ee2-08c72d9691af\" :answer-field/choices \"1282b5ae-e8e0-5fbd-91f3-9ef00f1ed768\"] [:db/add \"bc3140f2-15c8-5cf2-9ee2-08c72d9691af\" :answer-field/choices \"fc076000-db2a-5052-b4c4-0e2e2eca2e22\"] [:db/add \"bc3140f2-15c8-5cf2-9ee2-08c72d9691af\" :answer-field/choices \"0591c87c-b5fd-5b16-8be3-400aa1f889a5\"] [:db/add \"bc3140f2-15c8-5cf2-9ee2-08c72d9691af\" :answer-field/correct \"2d46568f-35d0-59e3-bb81-1bf1bf2f5835\"] [:db/ensure \"bc3140f2-15c8-5cf2-9ee2-08c72d9691af\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"7bb97d40-751e-5a89-8260-47ab1a2975f5\" :question/id #uuid \"7bb97d40-751e-5a89-8260-47ab1a2975f5\"] [:db/add \"7bb97d40-751e-5a89-8260-47ab1a2975f5\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=4 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|4 x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"7bb97d40-751e-5a89-8260-47ab1a2975f5\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{4}=1$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|4 x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"7bb97d40-751e-5a89-8260-47ab1a2975f5\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"7bb97d40-751e-5a89-8260-47ab1a2975f5\" :question/answer-fields \"bc3140f2-15c8-5cf2-9ee2-08c72d9691af\"] [:db/ensure \"7bb97d40-751e-5a89-8260-47ab1a2975f5\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"7bb97d40-751e-5a89-8260-47ab1a2975f5\"] [:db/add \"bee9d946-5ccd-542f-bcec-8fddec40d364\" :answer/id #uuid \"bee9d946-5ccd-542f-bcec-8fddec40d364\"] [:db/add \"bee9d946-5ccd-542f-bcec-8fddec40d364\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"bee9d946-5ccd-542f-bcec-8fddec40d364\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"bee9d946-5ccd-542f-bcec-8fddec40d364\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"cc55ef6e-03b9-592e-8942-663ffeec6c1e\" :answer/id #uuid \"cc55ef6e-03b9-592e-8942-663ffeec6c1e\"] [:db/add \"cc55ef6e-03b9-592e-8942-663ffeec6c1e\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"cc55ef6e-03b9-592e-8942-663ffeec6c1e\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"cc55ef6e-03b9-592e-8942-663ffeec6c1e\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"933d89e5-33d4-5d8e-99e1-4a57c2894d42\" :answer/id #uuid \"933d89e5-33d4-5d8e-99e1-4a57c2894d42\"] [:db/add \"933d89e5-33d4-5d8e-99e1-4a57c2894d42\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"933d89e5-33d4-5d8e-99e1-4a57c2894d42\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"933d89e5-33d4-5d8e-99e1-4a57c2894d42\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"d384d25f-4a4f-5e6d-8419-95cdb4afd4f0\" :answer/id #uuid \"d384d25f-4a4f-5e6d-8419-95cdb4afd4f0\"] [:db/add \"d384d25f-4a4f-5e6d-8419-95cdb4afd4f0\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"d384d25f-4a4f-5e6d-8419-95cdb4afd4f0\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{15}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"d384d25f-4a4f-5e6d-8419-95cdb4afd4f0\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"10d5ce71-080a-5c4f-a79a-5af969e4199f\" :answer/id #uuid \"10d5ce71-080a-5c4f-a79a-5af969e4199f\"] [:db/add \"10d5ce71-080a-5c4f-a79a-5af969e4199f\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"10d5ce71-080a-5c4f-a79a-5af969e4199f\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{8}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"10d5ce71-080a-5c4f-a79a-5af969e4199f\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"ad967691-4e47-55c5-954b-2976bd4e4f9c\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"ad967691-4e47-55c5-954b-2976bd4e4f9c\"] [:db/add \"ad967691-4e47-55c5-954b-2976bd4e4f9c\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"ad967691-4e47-55c5-954b-2976bd4e4f9c\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"ad967691-4e47-55c5-954b-2976bd4e4f9c\" :answer-field/choices \"bee9d946-5ccd-542f-bcec-8fddec40d364\"] [:db/add \"ad967691-4e47-55c5-954b-2976bd4e4f9c\" :answer-field/choices \"cc55ef6e-03b9-592e-8942-663ffeec6c1e\"] [:db/add \"ad967691-4e47-55c5-954b-2976bd4e4f9c\" :answer-field/choices \"933d89e5-33d4-5d8e-99e1-4a57c2894d42\"] [:db/add \"ad967691-4e47-55c5-954b-2976bd4e4f9c\" :answer-field/choices \"d384d25f-4a4f-5e6d-8419-95cdb4afd4f0\"] [:db/add \"ad967691-4e47-55c5-954b-2976bd4e4f9c\" :answer-field/choices \"10d5ce71-080a-5c4f-a79a-5af969e4199f\"] [:db/add \"ad967691-4e47-55c5-954b-2976bd4e4f9c\" :answer-field/correct \"bee9d946-5ccd-542f-bcec-8fddec40d364\"] [:db/ensure \"ad967691-4e47-55c5-954b-2976bd4e4f9c\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"7a8b5646-0d93-57dd-bce0-4189d3f0c2b9\" :question/id #uuid \"7a8b5646-0d93-57dd-bce0-4189d3f0c2b9\"] [:db/add \"7a8b5646-0d93-57dd-bce0-4189d3f0c2b9\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=5 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|5 x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"7a8b5646-0d93-57dd-bce0-4189d3f0c2b9\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{5}=\\\\frac{4}{5}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|5 x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"7a8b5646-0d93-57dd-bce0-4189d3f0c2b9\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"7a8b5646-0d93-57dd-bce0-4189d3f0c2b9\" :question/answer-fields \"ad967691-4e47-55c5-954b-2976bd4e4f9c\"] [:db/ensure \"7a8b5646-0d93-57dd-bce0-4189d3f0c2b9\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"7a8b5646-0d93-57dd-bce0-4189d3f0c2b9\"] [:db/add \"be462b5e-5b40-5509-8d1c-2b219e3afd8a\" :answer/id #uuid \"be462b5e-5b40-5509-8d1c-2b219e3afd8a\"] [:db/add \"be462b5e-5b40-5509-8d1c-2b219e3afd8a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"be462b5e-5b40-5509-8d1c-2b219e3afd8a\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"be462b5e-5b40-5509-8d1c-2b219e3afd8a\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"fa7f6192-1c3e-5718-9359-76c99aeb88e0\" :answer/id #uuid \"fa7f6192-1c3e-5718-9359-76c99aeb88e0\"] [:db/add \"fa7f6192-1c3e-5718-9359-76c99aeb88e0\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"fa7f6192-1c3e-5718-9359-76c99aeb88e0\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"fa7f6192-1c3e-5718-9359-76c99aeb88e0\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"6f92b6de-9a9e-580b-a58e-4a2e8748382b\" :answer/id #uuid \"6f92b6de-9a9e-580b-a58e-4a2e8748382b\"] [:db/add \"6f92b6de-9a9e-580b-a58e-4a2e8748382b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"6f92b6de-9a9e-580b-a58e-4a2e8748382b\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{2}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"6f92b6de-9a9e-580b-a58e-4a2e8748382b\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"acfe1411-a20d-50b2-9786-78651d1d8b99\" :answer/id #uuid \"acfe1411-a20d-50b2-9786-78651d1d8b99\"] [:db/add \"acfe1411-a20d-50b2-9786-78651d1d8b99\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"acfe1411-a20d-50b2-9786-78651d1d8b99\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{6}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"acfe1411-a20d-50b2-9786-78651d1d8b99\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"d4b7acfd-650c-5723-95d6-0142a81b2358\" :answer/id #uuid \"d4b7acfd-650c-5723-95d6-0142a81b2358\"] [:db/add \"d4b7acfd-650c-5723-95d6-0142a81b2358\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"d4b7acfd-650c-5723-95d6-0142a81b2358\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"d4b7acfd-650c-5723-95d6-0142a81b2358\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"2dc6375a-33b1-597f-8bdc-f368b50d332a\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"2dc6375a-33b1-597f-8bdc-f368b50d332a\"] [:db/add \"2dc6375a-33b1-597f-8bdc-f368b50d332a\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"2dc6375a-33b1-597f-8bdc-f368b50d332a\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"2dc6375a-33b1-597f-8bdc-f368b50d332a\" :answer-field/choices \"be462b5e-5b40-5509-8d1c-2b219e3afd8a\"] [:db/add \"2dc6375a-33b1-597f-8bdc-f368b50d332a\" :answer-field/choices \"fa7f6192-1c3e-5718-9359-76c99aeb88e0\"] [:db/add \"2dc6375a-33b1-597f-8bdc-f368b50d332a\" :answer-field/choices \"6f92b6de-9a9e-580b-a58e-4a2e8748382b\"] [:db/add \"2dc6375a-33b1-597f-8bdc-f368b50d332a\" :answer-field/choices \"acfe1411-a20d-50b2-9786-78651d1d8b99\"] [:db/add \"2dc6375a-33b1-597f-8bdc-f368b50d332a\" :answer-field/choices \"d4b7acfd-650c-5723-95d6-0142a81b2358\"] [:db/add \"2dc6375a-33b1-597f-8bdc-f368b50d332a\" :answer-field/correct \"be462b5e-5b40-5509-8d1c-2b219e3afd8a\"] [:db/ensure \"2dc6375a-33b1-597f-8bdc-f368b50d332a\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"bb1a95f2-7242-5d0c-b87d-badd20589922\" :question/id #uuid \"bb1a95f2-7242-5d0c-b87d-badd20589922\"] [:db/add \"bb1a95f2-7242-5d0c-b87d-badd20589922\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=5 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|5 x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"bb1a95f2-7242-5d0c-b87d-badd20589922\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{5}=\\\\frac{2}{5}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|5 x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{2}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{2}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"bb1a95f2-7242-5d0c-b87d-badd20589922\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"bb1a95f2-7242-5d0c-b87d-badd20589922\" :question/answer-fields \"2dc6375a-33b1-597f-8bdc-f368b50d332a\"] [:db/ensure \"bb1a95f2-7242-5d0c-b87d-badd20589922\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"bb1a95f2-7242-5d0c-b87d-badd20589922\"] [:db/add \"9c42b6f6-9782-54c6-b192-1cade00c9715\" :answer/id #uuid \"9c42b6f6-9782-54c6-b192-1cade00c9715\"] [:db/add \"9c42b6f6-9782-54c6-b192-1cade00c9715\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"9c42b6f6-9782-54c6-b192-1cade00c9715\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"9c42b6f6-9782-54c6-b192-1cade00c9715\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"e2c135f3-6e96-56c7-8c08-61da63dce8dc\" :answer/id #uuid \"e2c135f3-6e96-56c7-8c08-61da63dce8dc\"] [:db/add \"e2c135f3-6e96-56c7-8c08-61da63dce8dc\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"e2c135f3-6e96-56c7-8c08-61da63dce8dc\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"e2c135f3-6e96-56c7-8c08-61da63dce8dc\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"9b0731ce-6786-56be-bb0a-e9b8f1a2dd58\" :answer/id #uuid \"9b0731ce-6786-56be-bb0a-e9b8f1a2dd58\"] [:db/add \"9b0731ce-6786-56be-bb0a-e9b8f1a2dd58\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"9b0731ce-6786-56be-bb0a-e9b8f1a2dd58\" :answer/value \"\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\"] [:db/ensure \"9b0731ce-6786-56be-bb0a-e9b8f1a2dd58\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"54f7586f-f527-51b7-88bc-73fb71733563\" :answer/id #uuid \"54f7586f-f527-51b7-88bc-73fb71733563\"] [:db/add \"54f7586f-f527-51b7-88bc-73fb71733563\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"54f7586f-f527-51b7-88bc-73fb71733563\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"54f7586f-f527-51b7-88bc-73fb71733563\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"a654c3c1-4947-5c5f-a861-a0df2f21663e\" :answer/id #uuid \"a654c3c1-4947-5c5f-a861-a0df2f21663e\"] [:db/add \"a654c3c1-4947-5c5f-a861-a0df2f21663e\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"a654c3c1-4947-5c5f-a861-a0df2f21663e\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"a654c3c1-4947-5c5f-a861-a0df2f21663e\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"9a0278f0-7eaf-5656-81fa-58702d8db23d\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"9a0278f0-7eaf-5656-81fa-58702d8db23d\"] [:db/add \"9a0278f0-7eaf-5656-81fa-58702d8db23d\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"9a0278f0-7eaf-5656-81fa-58702d8db23d\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"9a0278f0-7eaf-5656-81fa-58702d8db23d\" :answer-field/choices \"9c42b6f6-9782-54c6-b192-1cade00c9715\"] [:db/add \"9a0278f0-7eaf-5656-81fa-58702d8db23d\" :answer-field/choices \"e2c135f3-6e96-56c7-8c08-61da63dce8dc\"] [:db/add \"9a0278f0-7eaf-5656-81fa-58702d8db23d\" :answer-field/choices \"9b0731ce-6786-56be-bb0a-e9b8f1a2dd58\"] [:db/add \"9a0278f0-7eaf-5656-81fa-58702d8db23d\" :answer-field/choices \"54f7586f-f527-51b7-88bc-73fb71733563\"] [:db/add \"9a0278f0-7eaf-5656-81fa-58702d8db23d\" :answer-field/choices \"a654c3c1-4947-5c5f-a861-a0df2f21663e\"] [:db/add \"9a0278f0-7eaf-5656-81fa-58702d8db23d\" :answer-field/correct \"e2c135f3-6e96-56c7-8c08-61da63dce8dc\"] [:db/ensure \"9a0278f0-7eaf-5656-81fa-58702d8db23d\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"a389fa12-c56e-5666-b913-2d1803b92aee\" :question/id #uuid \"a389fa12-c56e-5666-b913-2d1803b92aee\"] [:db/add \"a389fa12-c56e-5666-b913-2d1803b92aee\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=2 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|2 x|\\\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"a389fa12-c56e-5666-b913-2d1803b92aee\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|2 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{2}=2$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|2 x|\\\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"a389fa12-c56e-5666-b913-2d1803b92aee\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"a389fa12-c56e-5666-b913-2d1803b92aee\" :question/answer-fields \"9a0278f0-7eaf-5656-81fa-58702d8db23d\"] [:db/ensure \"a389fa12-c56e-5666-b913-2d1803b92aee\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"a389fa12-c56e-5666-b913-2d1803b92aee\"] [:db/add \"d337e478-9e3d-5fee-a8e2-b96923986bc6\" :answer/id #uuid \"d337e478-9e3d-5fee-a8e2-b96923986bc6\"] [:db/add \"d337e478-9e3d-5fee-a8e2-b96923986bc6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"d337e478-9e3d-5fee-a8e2-b96923986bc6\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"d337e478-9e3d-5fee-a8e2-b96923986bc6\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"5f54c10e-b1d1-502a-887b-5f22b474dd2c\" :answer/id #uuid \"5f54c10e-b1d1-502a-887b-5f22b474dd2c\"] [:db/add \"5f54c10e-b1d1-502a-887b-5f22b474dd2c\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"5f54c10e-b1d1-502a-887b-5f22b474dd2c\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"5f54c10e-b1d1-502a-887b-5f22b474dd2c\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"4c82403a-eca7-54a8-9c6f-185d871da9c4\" :answer/id #uuid \"4c82403a-eca7-54a8-9c6f-185d871da9c4\"] [:db/add \"4c82403a-eca7-54a8-9c6f-185d871da9c4\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"4c82403a-eca7-54a8-9c6f-185d871da9c4\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"4c82403a-eca7-54a8-9c6f-185d871da9c4\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"eaa26936-cc54-54db-ba96-50da2dc56209\" :answer/id #uuid \"eaa26936-cc54-54db-ba96-50da2dc56209\"] [:db/add \"eaa26936-cc54-54db-ba96-50da2dc56209\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"eaa26936-cc54-54db-ba96-50da2dc56209\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{20}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"eaa26936-cc54-54db-ba96-50da2dc56209\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"29b6b7ce-9447-5530-8b85-6f66725c310d\" :answer/id #uuid \"29b6b7ce-9447-5530-8b85-6f66725c310d\"] [:db/add \"29b6b7ce-9447-5530-8b85-6f66725c310d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"29b6b7ce-9447-5530-8b85-6f66725c310d\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{10}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"29b6b7ce-9447-5530-8b85-6f66725c310d\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"00e551b0-4ea8-5b08-ad11-54101d321313\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"00e551b0-4ea8-5b08-ad11-54101d321313\"] [:db/add \"00e551b0-4ea8-5b08-ad11-54101d321313\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"00e551b0-4ea8-5b08-ad11-54101d321313\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"00e551b0-4ea8-5b08-ad11-54101d321313\" :answer-field/choices \"d337e478-9e3d-5fee-a8e2-b96923986bc6\"] [:db/add \"00e551b0-4ea8-5b08-ad11-54101d321313\" :answer-field/choices \"5f54c10e-b1d1-502a-887b-5f22b474dd2c\"] [:db/add \"00e551b0-4ea8-5b08-ad11-54101d321313\" :answer-field/choices \"4c82403a-eca7-54a8-9c6f-185d871da9c4\"] [:db/add \"00e551b0-4ea8-5b08-ad11-54101d321313\" :answer-field/choices \"eaa26936-cc54-54db-ba96-50da2dc56209\"] [:db/add \"00e551b0-4ea8-5b08-ad11-54101d321313\" :answer-field/choices \"29b6b7ce-9447-5530-8b85-6f66725c310d\"] [:db/add \"00e551b0-4ea8-5b08-ad11-54101d321313\" :answer-field/correct \"4c82403a-eca7-54a8-9c6f-185d871da9c4\"] [:db/ensure \"00e551b0-4ea8-5b08-ad11-54101d321313\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"41707ce6-ae13-5f46-a338-b37dceac0ae7\" :question/id #uuid \"41707ce6-ae13-5f46-a338-b37dceac0ae7\"] [:db/add \"41707ce6-ae13-5f46-a338-b37dceac0ae7\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=5 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{|5 x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"41707ce6-ae13-5f46-a338-b37dceac0ae7\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $1\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{5}=\\\\frac{1}{5}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{|5 x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"41707ce6-ae13-5f46-a338-b37dceac0ae7\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"41707ce6-ae13-5f46-a338-b37dceac0ae7\" :question/answer-fields \"00e551b0-4ea8-5b08-ad11-54101d321313\"] [:db/ensure \"41707ce6-ae13-5f46-a338-b37dceac0ae7\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"41707ce6-ae13-5f46-a338-b37dceac0ae7\"] [:db/add \"a2c26a46-a940-5ebd-b1d4-1593d67186d0\" :answer/id #uuid \"a2c26a46-a940-5ebd-b1d4-1593d67186d0\"] [:db/add \"a2c26a46-a940-5ebd-b1d4-1593d67186d0\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"a2c26a46-a940-5ebd-b1d4-1593d67186d0\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"a2c26a46-a940-5ebd-b1d4-1593d67186d0\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"312f0b64-0080-560c-8c94-b1307ebc782d\" :answer/id #uuid \"312f0b64-0080-560c-8c94-b1307ebc782d\"] [:db/add \"312f0b64-0080-560c-8c94-b1307ebc782d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"312f0b64-0080-560c-8c94-b1307ebc782d\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"312f0b64-0080-560c-8c94-b1307ebc782d\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"93b49532-0f6a-5a43-8698-40eebc6646c1\" :answer/id #uuid \"93b49532-0f6a-5a43-8698-40eebc6646c1\"] [:db/add \"93b49532-0f6a-5a43-8698-40eebc6646c1\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"93b49532-0f6a-5a43-8698-40eebc6646c1\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"93b49532-0f6a-5a43-8698-40eebc6646c1\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"791b8920-8fd6-521e-964b-9313f417245f\" :answer/id #uuid \"791b8920-8fd6-521e-964b-9313f417245f\"] [:db/add \"791b8920-8fd6-521e-964b-9313f417245f\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"791b8920-8fd6-521e-964b-9313f417245f\" :answer/value \"-1\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"791b8920-8fd6-521e-964b-9313f417245f\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"e6b6b55d-b4bd-5dd2-b9c9-79955938bd22\" :answer/id #uuid \"e6b6b55d-b4bd-5dd2-b9c9-79955938bd22\"] [:db/add \"e6b6b55d-b4bd-5dd2-b9c9-79955938bd22\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"e6b6b55d-b4bd-5dd2-b9c9-79955938bd22\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"e6b6b55d-b4bd-5dd2-b9c9-79955938bd22\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"ed7dfad9-5215-5ab8-ba24-9aa7d64ffef6\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"ed7dfad9-5215-5ab8-ba24-9aa7d64ffef6\"] [:db/add \"ed7dfad9-5215-5ab8-ba24-9aa7d64ffef6\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"ed7dfad9-5215-5ab8-ba24-9aa7d64ffef6\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"ed7dfad9-5215-5ab8-ba24-9aa7d64ffef6\" :answer-field/choices \"a2c26a46-a940-5ebd-b1d4-1593d67186d0\"] [:db/add \"ed7dfad9-5215-5ab8-ba24-9aa7d64ffef6\" :answer-field/choices \"312f0b64-0080-560c-8c94-b1307ebc782d\"] [:db/add \"ed7dfad9-5215-5ab8-ba24-9aa7d64ffef6\" :answer-field/choices \"93b49532-0f6a-5a43-8698-40eebc6646c1\"] [:db/add \"ed7dfad9-5215-5ab8-ba24-9aa7d64ffef6\" :answer-field/choices \"791b8920-8fd6-521e-964b-9313f417245f\"] [:db/add \"ed7dfad9-5215-5ab8-ba24-9aa7d64ffef6\" :answer-field/choices \"e6b6b55d-b4bd-5dd2-b9c9-79955938bd22\"] [:db/add \"ed7dfad9-5215-5ab8-ba24-9aa7d64ffef6\" :answer-field/correct \"312f0b64-0080-560c-8c94-b1307ebc782d\"] [:db/ensure \"ed7dfad9-5215-5ab8-ba24-9aa7d64ffef6\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"c5ea2443-4f53-5b5f-8fb9-dbfdaf0c20f1\" :question/id #uuid \"c5ea2443-4f53-5b5f-8fb9-dbfdaf0c20f1\"] [:db/add \"c5ea2443-4f53-5b5f-8fb9-dbfdaf0c20f1\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|2 x|\\\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|2 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"c5ea2443-4f53-5b5f-8fb9-dbfdaf0c20f1\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|2 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{2}=1$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|2 x|\\\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"c5ea2443-4f53-5b5f-8fb9-dbfdaf0c20f1\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"c5ea2443-4f53-5b5f-8fb9-dbfdaf0c20f1\" :question/answer-fields \"ed7dfad9-5215-5ab8-ba24-9aa7d64ffef6\"] [:db/ensure \"c5ea2443-4f53-5b5f-8fb9-dbfdaf0c20f1\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"c5ea2443-4f53-5b5f-8fb9-dbfdaf0c20f1\"] [:db/add \"2dad638d-6795-5bba-a28c-d4dae1791941\" :answer/id #uuid \"2dad638d-6795-5bba-a28c-d4dae1791941\"] [:db/add \"2dad638d-6795-5bba-a28c-d4dae1791941\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"2dad638d-6795-5bba-a28c-d4dae1791941\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(6 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"2dad638d-6795-5bba-a28c-d4dae1791941\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"c454ddf1-b042-548b-979d-26163cd00889\" :answer/id #uuid \"c454ddf1-b042-548b-979d-26163cd00889\"] [:db/add \"c454ddf1-b042-548b-979d-26163cd00889\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"c454ddf1-b042-548b-979d-26163cd00889\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"c454ddf1-b042-548b-979d-26163cd00889\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"94df93dd-8a07-5cd0-9a0e-9ec4ca2f19e9\" :answer/id #uuid \"94df93dd-8a07-5cd0-9a0e-9ec4ca2f19e9\"] [:db/add \"94df93dd-8a07-5cd0-9a0e-9ec4ca2f19e9\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"94df93dd-8a07-5cd0-9a0e-9ec4ca2f19e9\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(6 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"94df93dd-8a07-5cd0-9a0e-9ec4ca2f19e9\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"363e5719-bea1-5a90-b7cd-1a4c44850541\" :answer/id #uuid \"363e5719-bea1-5a90-b7cd-1a4c44850541\"] [:db/add \"363e5719-bea1-5a90-b7cd-1a4c44850541\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"363e5719-bea1-5a90-b7cd-1a4c44850541\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{3 x}{2} \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"363e5719-bea1-5a90-b7cd-1a4c44850541\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"2337c541-befe-5e68-829f-fa9ded0fb13c\" :answer/id #uuid \"2337c541-befe-5e68-829f-fa9ded0fb13c\"] [:db/add \"2337c541-befe-5e68-829f-fa9ded0fb13c\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"2337c541-befe-5e68-829f-fa9ded0fb13c\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"2337c541-befe-5e68-829f-fa9ded0fb13c\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"00e82129-7eda-53bc-88cc-0e45dcbad61e\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"00e82129-7eda-53bc-88cc-0e45dcbad61e\"] [:db/add \"00e82129-7eda-53bc-88cc-0e45dcbad61e\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"00e82129-7eda-53bc-88cc-0e45dcbad61e\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"00e82129-7eda-53bc-88cc-0e45dcbad61e\" :answer-field/choices \"2dad638d-6795-5bba-a28c-d4dae1791941\"] [:db/add \"00e82129-7eda-53bc-88cc-0e45dcbad61e\" :answer-field/choices \"c454ddf1-b042-548b-979d-26163cd00889\"] [:db/add \"00e82129-7eda-53bc-88cc-0e45dcbad61e\" :answer-field/choices \"94df93dd-8a07-5cd0-9a0e-9ec4ca2f19e9\"] [:db/add \"00e82129-7eda-53bc-88cc-0e45dcbad61e\" :answer-field/choices \"363e5719-bea1-5a90-b7cd-1a4c44850541\"] [:db/add \"00e82129-7eda-53bc-88cc-0e45dcbad61e\" :answer-field/choices \"2337c541-befe-5e68-829f-fa9ded0fb13c\"] [:db/add \"00e82129-7eda-53bc-88cc-0e45dcbad61e\" :answer-field/correct \"2337c541-befe-5e68-829f-fa9ded0fb13c\"] [:db/ensure \"00e82129-7eda-53bc-88cc-0e45dcbad61e\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"9f5792d0-9c5b-52ee-9935-fa165bdce327\" :question/id #uuid \"9f5792d0-9c5b-52ee-9935-fa165bdce327\"] [:db/add \"9f5792d0-9c5b-52ee-9935-fa165bdce327\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|3 x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"9f5792d0-9c5b-52ee-9935-fa165bdce327\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{3}=\\\\frac{4}{3}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|3 x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"9f5792d0-9c5b-52ee-9935-fa165bdce327\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"9f5792d0-9c5b-52ee-9935-fa165bdce327\" :question/answer-fields \"00e82129-7eda-53bc-88cc-0e45dcbad61e\"] [:db/ensure \"9f5792d0-9c5b-52ee-9935-fa165bdce327\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"9f5792d0-9c5b-52ee-9935-fa165bdce327\"] [:db/add \"c232732a-db29-5875-8154-305ac841267d\" :answer/id #uuid \"c232732a-db29-5875-8154-305ac841267d\"] [:db/add \"c232732a-db29-5875-8154-305ac841267d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"c232732a-db29-5875-8154-305ac841267d\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"c232732a-db29-5875-8154-305ac841267d\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"ab63aa8c-62ba-5c8c-b205-9e1d92a9052c\" :answer/id #uuid \"ab63aa8c-62ba-5c8c-b205-9e1d92a9052c\"] [:db/add \"ab63aa8c-62ba-5c8c-b205-9e1d92a9052c\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"ab63aa8c-62ba-5c8c-b205-9e1d92a9052c\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"ab63aa8c-62ba-5c8c-b205-9e1d92a9052c\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"d3b722ee-7fcd-5510-ba61-91bb9c65258e\" :answer/id #uuid \"d3b722ee-7fcd-5510-ba61-91bb9c65258e\"] [:db/add \"d3b722ee-7fcd-5510-ba61-91bb9c65258e\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"d3b722ee-7fcd-5510-ba61-91bb9c65258e\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"d3b722ee-7fcd-5510-ba61-91bb9c65258e\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"25b04917-3e2e-511f-af2b-c28a5d7511f5\" :answer/id #uuid \"25b04917-3e2e-511f-af2b-c28a5d7511f5\"] [:db/add \"25b04917-3e2e-511f-af2b-c28a5d7511f5\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"25b04917-3e2e-511f-af2b-c28a5d7511f5\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(10 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"25b04917-3e2e-511f-af2b-c28a5d7511f5\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"e62a8238-b6cf-5f3a-80d9-d7b7a465c046\" :answer/id #uuid \"e62a8238-b6cf-5f3a-80d9-d7b7a465c046\"] [:db/add \"e62a8238-b6cf-5f3a-80d9-d7b7a465c046\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"e62a8238-b6cf-5f3a-80d9-d7b7a465c046\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"e62a8238-b6cf-5f3a-80d9-d7b7a465c046\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"cbb9e342-9d9a-5b33-a07b-d9352e99a26a\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"cbb9e342-9d9a-5b33-a07b-d9352e99a26a\"] [:db/add \"cbb9e342-9d9a-5b33-a07b-d9352e99a26a\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"cbb9e342-9d9a-5b33-a07b-d9352e99a26a\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"cbb9e342-9d9a-5b33-a07b-d9352e99a26a\" :answer-field/choices \"c232732a-db29-5875-8154-305ac841267d\"] [:db/add \"cbb9e342-9d9a-5b33-a07b-d9352e99a26a\" :answer-field/choices \"ab63aa8c-62ba-5c8c-b205-9e1d92a9052c\"] [:db/add \"cbb9e342-9d9a-5b33-a07b-d9352e99a26a\" :answer-field/choices \"d3b722ee-7fcd-5510-ba61-91bb9c65258e\"] [:db/add \"cbb9e342-9d9a-5b33-a07b-d9352e99a26a\" :answer-field/choices \"25b04917-3e2e-511f-af2b-c28a5d7511f5\"] [:db/add \"cbb9e342-9d9a-5b33-a07b-d9352e99a26a\" :answer-field/choices \"e62a8238-b6cf-5f3a-80d9-d7b7a465c046\"] [:db/add \"cbb9e342-9d9a-5b33-a07b-d9352e99a26a\" :answer-field/correct \"c232732a-db29-5875-8154-305ac841267d\"] [:db/ensure \"cbb9e342-9d9a-5b33-a07b-d9352e99a26a\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"bacbded8-6884-5d02-af40-16c8adf1cd96\" :question/id #uuid \"bacbded8-6884-5d02-af40-16c8adf1cd96\"] [:db/add \"bacbded8-6884-5d02-af40-16c8adf1cd96\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|5 x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"bacbded8-6884-5d02-af40-16c8adf1cd96\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{5}=\\\\frac{4}{5}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|5 x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"bacbded8-6884-5d02-af40-16c8adf1cd96\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"bacbded8-6884-5d02-af40-16c8adf1cd96\" :question/answer-fields \"cbb9e342-9d9a-5b33-a07b-d9352e99a26a\"] [:db/ensure \"bacbded8-6884-5d02-af40-16c8adf1cd96\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"bacbded8-6884-5d02-af40-16c8adf1cd96\"] [:db/add \"40feda46-d342-5cef-ba12-30773f0d3723\" :answer/id #uuid \"40feda46-d342-5cef-ba12-30773f0d3723\"] [:db/add \"40feda46-d342-5cef-ba12-30773f0d3723\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"40feda46-d342-5cef-ba12-30773f0d3723\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"40feda46-d342-5cef-ba12-30773f0d3723\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"56ef5604-2eb6-5198-9605-7786a819ee07\" :answer/id #uuid \"56ef5604-2eb6-5198-9605-7786a819ee07\"] [:db/add \"56ef5604-2eb6-5198-9605-7786a819ee07\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"56ef5604-2eb6-5198-9605-7786a819ee07\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"56ef5604-2eb6-5198-9605-7786a819ee07\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"c270fd30-ee22-5180-b732-d29668ca15e3\" :answer/id #uuid \"c270fd30-ee22-5180-b732-d29668ca15e3\"] [:db/add \"c270fd30-ee22-5180-b732-d29668ca15e3\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"c270fd30-ee22-5180-b732-d29668ca15e3\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"c270fd30-ee22-5180-b732-d29668ca15e3\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"59519cf4-e762-57cb-a030-105b00e1faac\" :answer/id #uuid \"59519cf4-e762-57cb-a030-105b00e1faac\"] [:db/add \"59519cf4-e762-57cb-a030-105b00e1faac\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"59519cf4-e762-57cb-a030-105b00e1faac\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{3 x}{2} \\\\right)}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"59519cf4-e762-57cb-a030-105b00e1faac\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"0f571e69-41b4-528e-88d7-d84f2aa8259c\" :answer/id #uuid \"0f571e69-41b4-528e-88d7-d84f2aa8259c\"] [:db/add \"0f571e69-41b4-528e-88d7-d84f2aa8259c\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"0f571e69-41b4-528e-88d7-d84f2aa8259c\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(6 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"0f571e69-41b4-528e-88d7-d84f2aa8259c\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"ecf22287-e7ac-53c6-b876-fd2048726cd4\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"ecf22287-e7ac-53c6-b876-fd2048726cd4\"] [:db/add \"ecf22287-e7ac-53c6-b876-fd2048726cd4\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"ecf22287-e7ac-53c6-b876-fd2048726cd4\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"ecf22287-e7ac-53c6-b876-fd2048726cd4\" :answer-field/choices \"40feda46-d342-5cef-ba12-30773f0d3723\"] [:db/add \"ecf22287-e7ac-53c6-b876-fd2048726cd4\" :answer-field/choices \"56ef5604-2eb6-5198-9605-7786a819ee07\"] [:db/add \"ecf22287-e7ac-53c6-b876-fd2048726cd4\" :answer-field/choices \"c270fd30-ee22-5180-b732-d29668ca15e3\"] [:db/add \"ecf22287-e7ac-53c6-b876-fd2048726cd4\" :answer-field/choices \"59519cf4-e762-57cb-a030-105b00e1faac\"] [:db/add \"ecf22287-e7ac-53c6-b876-fd2048726cd4\" :answer-field/choices \"0f571e69-41b4-528e-88d7-d84f2aa8259c\"] [:db/add \"ecf22287-e7ac-53c6-b876-fd2048726cd4\" :answer-field/correct \"40feda46-d342-5cef-ba12-30773f0d3723\"] [:db/ensure \"ecf22287-e7ac-53c6-b876-fd2048726cd4\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"0a802c2b-6d44-5e3b-8524-69c4811ecad9\" :question/id #uuid \"0a802c2b-6d44-5e3b-8524-69c4811ecad9\"] [:db/add \"0a802c2b-6d44-5e3b-8524-69c4811ecad9\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|3 x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"0a802c2b-6d44-5e3b-8524-69c4811ecad9\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{3}=1$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|3 x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"0a802c2b-6d44-5e3b-8524-69c4811ecad9\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"0a802c2b-6d44-5e3b-8524-69c4811ecad9\" :question/answer-fields \"ecf22287-e7ac-53c6-b876-fd2048726cd4\"] [:db/ensure \"0a802c2b-6d44-5e3b-8524-69c4811ecad9\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"0a802c2b-6d44-5e3b-8524-69c4811ecad9\"] [:db/add \"1d070ab3-811f-5739-b6ab-63bd68171300\" :answer/id #uuid \"1d070ab3-811f-5739-b6ab-63bd68171300\"] [:db/add \"1d070ab3-811f-5739-b6ab-63bd68171300\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"1d070ab3-811f-5739-b6ab-63bd68171300\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"1d070ab3-811f-5739-b6ab-63bd68171300\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"1407ee65-2f79-586e-81a6-8fb7f82329e3\" :answer/id #uuid \"1407ee65-2f79-586e-81a6-8fb7f82329e3\"] [:db/add \"1407ee65-2f79-586e-81a6-8fb7f82329e3\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"1407ee65-2f79-586e-81a6-8fb7f82329e3\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(8 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"1407ee65-2f79-586e-81a6-8fb7f82329e3\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"29726943-6c48-5d78-9ab1-9d5e4826a361\" :answer/id #uuid \"29726943-6c48-5d78-9ab1-9d5e4826a361\"] [:db/add \"29726943-6c48-5d78-9ab1-9d5e4826a361\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"29726943-6c48-5d78-9ab1-9d5e4826a361\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(8 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"29726943-6c48-5d78-9ab1-9d5e4826a361\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"dc598021-6c66-5115-ac71-3cd33ebc8da9\" :answer/id #uuid \"dc598021-6c66-5115-ac71-3cd33ebc8da9\"] [:db/add \"dc598021-6c66-5115-ac71-3cd33ebc8da9\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"dc598021-6c66-5115-ac71-3cd33ebc8da9\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"dc598021-6c66-5115-ac71-3cd33ebc8da9\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"f6e19d42-27e3-5b3a-beef-f63000b64093\" :answer/id #uuid \"f6e19d42-27e3-5b3a-beef-f63000b64093\"] [:db/add \"f6e19d42-27e3-5b3a-beef-f63000b64093\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"f6e19d42-27e3-5b3a-beef-f63000b64093\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"f6e19d42-27e3-5b3a-beef-f63000b64093\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"021c7d86-f00a-57fa-8bfe-7262334eefe1\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"021c7d86-f00a-57fa-8bfe-7262334eefe1\"] [:db/add \"021c7d86-f00a-57fa-8bfe-7262334eefe1\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"021c7d86-f00a-57fa-8bfe-7262334eefe1\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"021c7d86-f00a-57fa-8bfe-7262334eefe1\" :answer-field/choices \"1d070ab3-811f-5739-b6ab-63bd68171300\"] [:db/add \"021c7d86-f00a-57fa-8bfe-7262334eefe1\" :answer-field/choices \"1407ee65-2f79-586e-81a6-8fb7f82329e3\"] [:db/add \"021c7d86-f00a-57fa-8bfe-7262334eefe1\" :answer-field/choices \"29726943-6c48-5d78-9ab1-9d5e4826a361\"] [:db/add \"021c7d86-f00a-57fa-8bfe-7262334eefe1\" :answer-field/choices \"dc598021-6c66-5115-ac71-3cd33ebc8da9\"] [:db/add \"021c7d86-f00a-57fa-8bfe-7262334eefe1\" :answer-field/choices \"f6e19d42-27e3-5b3a-beef-f63000b64093\"] [:db/add \"021c7d86-f00a-57fa-8bfe-7262334eefe1\" :answer-field/correct \"f6e19d42-27e3-5b3a-beef-f63000b64093\"] [:db/ensure \"021c7d86-f00a-57fa-8bfe-7262334eefe1\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"40b27085-34e6-58d6-ab38-f796eb2eb64b\" :question/id #uuid \"40b27085-34e6-58d6-ab38-f796eb2eb64b\"] [:db/add \"40b27085-34e6-58d6-ab38-f796eb2eb64b\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|4 x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"40b27085-34e6-58d6-ab38-f796eb2eb64b\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{4}=\\\\frac{1}{2}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|4 x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"40b27085-34e6-58d6-ab38-f796eb2eb64b\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"40b27085-34e6-58d6-ab38-f796eb2eb64b\" :question/answer-fields \"021c7d86-f00a-57fa-8bfe-7262334eefe1\"] [:db/ensure \"40b27085-34e6-58d6-ab38-f796eb2eb64b\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"40b27085-34e6-58d6-ab38-f796eb2eb64b\"] [:db/add \"35abe1d1-b7ba-531f-8f3e-5d308559245a\" :answer/id #uuid \"35abe1d1-b7ba-531f-8f3e-5d308559245a\"] [:db/add \"35abe1d1-b7ba-531f-8f3e-5d308559245a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"35abe1d1-b7ba-531f-8f3e-5d308559245a\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"35abe1d1-b7ba-531f-8f3e-5d308559245a\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"9a476002-ac5f-52af-bf76-63871a1b23ee\" :answer/id #uuid \"9a476002-ac5f-52af-bf76-63871a1b23ee\"] [:db/add \"9a476002-ac5f-52af-bf76-63871a1b23ee\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"9a476002-ac5f-52af-bf76-63871a1b23ee\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{8}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(8 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"9a476002-ac5f-52af-bf76-63871a1b23ee\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"61b87488-e1b1-56c7-8df9-6b876e4d81bd\" :answer/id #uuid \"61b87488-e1b1-56c7-8df9-6b876e4d81bd\"] [:db/add \"61b87488-e1b1-56c7-8df9-6b876e4d81bd\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"61b87488-e1b1-56c7-8